  "description": "A group of four progressive U.S. politicians — Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez, Rashida Tlaib, Ilhan Omar, and Ayanna Pressley — known for their collective advocacy on issues like climate change, racial justice, and economic inequality. The term 'The Squad' is a media and political label used to describe their unified stance and public presence. The meme references this real-world political group, which is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the context of the text overlay.",
